---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { getDomain } from '../utils/siteConfig';

const domain = getDomain();
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — MedGPT"
  description="Learn how MedGPT protects your health data. Our privacy policy explains data collection, usage, storage, and your rights under GDPR and CCPA."
  schemaType="legal"
>
  <div class="legal-content">
    <div class="container container--blog">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="updated-date">Last Updated: November 24, 2026</p>

      <p>PureScan AI and Wellness AI ("we," "our," or "us") operate the MedGPT mobile application (the "App") and the website {domain} (the "Site"). This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you use our App and Site.</p>

      <p>Please read this privacy policy carefully. If you do not agree with the terms of this privacy policy, please do not access the App or Site.</p>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>

      <h3>Information You Provide</h3>
      <p>We may collect information that you voluntarily provide when using MedGPT, including:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Medical reports, blood test results, lab documents, images, and photos you upload for analysis</li>
        <li>Health-related questions and queries you submit to the AI</li>
        <li>Feedback and support requests you send to us</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Automatically Collected Information</h3>
      <p>When you use the App or visit our Site, we may automatically collect:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Device information (device type, operating system, unique device identifiers)</li>
        <li>Usage data (features used, interaction patterns, session duration)</li>
        <li>Crash reports and performance data</li>
        <li>IP address and approximate location (country/region level only)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Provide, maintain, and improve the MedGPT service</li>
        <li>Process and analyze medical reports and health queries you submit</li>
        <li>Generate AI-powered health insights and explanations</li>
        <li>Monitor and analyze usage trends and preferences</li>
        <li>Detect, prevent, and address technical issues</li>
        <li>Send you service-related notifications</li>
        <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Data Processing &amp; AI Analysis</h2>
      <p>When you upload medical reports, images, photos, or documents, or ask health questions, that data is transmitted to third-party AI models—specifically <strong>Google Gemini</strong> and <strong>Groq</strong>—strictly to perform the requested analysis and generate educational insights and explanations.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Analysis-Only Processing:</strong> Your uploaded images, documents, and queries are sent to Google Gemini and Groq solely to provide the real-time AI analysis feature.</li>
        <li><strong>No Third-Party AI Storage or Training:</strong> Data sent to Google Gemini and Groq is <strong>not stored</strong> by those third-party AI providers after processing and is <strong>not</strong> used to train third-party AI models.</li>
        <li><strong>Prior User Consent:</strong> Before transmitting any data to Google Gemini or Groq for AI analysis, the App presents a clear disclosure and obtains your explicit consent.</li>
        <li><strong>Automated AI System:</strong> You are interacting with an automated AI system, not a human healthcare professional.</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>Important:</strong> MedGPT's AI analysis is educational in nature and should not be used as a substitute for professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment.</p>

      <h2>4. Data Sharing &amp; Disclosure</h2>
      <p>We do <strong>not</strong> sell, rent, or trade your personal or health information, and we do <strong>not</strong> use or share your health data for advertising, marketing, or data brokerage. Your uploaded images, photos, and documents are stored exclusively on our own servers (not third-party file storage) and are not shared with anyone except in the following limited circumstances:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Third-Party AI Analysis Providers (Google Gemini and Groq):</strong> Strictly to process your uploaded images, documents, and queries in real time for analysis, with zero storage or model training by those providers</li>
        <li><strong>Legal Requirements:</strong> When required by law, regulation, or legal process</li>
        <li><strong>Safety:</strong> To protect the rights, property, or safety of PureScan AI, Wellness AI, MedGPT, our users, or the public</li>
        <li><strong>Consent:</strong> With your explicit consent for any other purpose</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Data Security</h2>
      <p>We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your information on our own servers, including:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Encryption of data in transit (TLS/SSL)</li>
        <li>Encryption at rest for all uploaded images, photos, documents, and health data stored on our servers</li>
        <li>Secure data storage with strict access controls</li>
        <li>Regular security assessments and monitoring</li>
        <li>Employee access restrictions on a need-to-know basis</li>
      </ul>
      <p>While we strive to protect your personal information, no method of transmission over the Internet or electronic storage is 100% secure.</p>

      <h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>We retain your personal information only for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this Privacy Policy, unless a longer retention period is required or permitted by law:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>30-Day Temporary Storage on Our Servers:</strong> Uploaded images, photos, and documents are stored temporarily in encrypted form on our own servers and are <strong>automatically and permanently deleted after 30 days</strong>.</li>
        <li><strong>No Third-Party AI Storage:</strong> Images, documents, and queries sent to Google Gemini and Groq for analysis are not stored by those third-party providers.</li>
        <li><strong>Immediate User Deletion:</strong> You do not have to wait 30 days—you may permanently delete your stored data immediately at any time as described in Section 7.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>7. Your Rights &amp; Immediate Data Deletion</h2>

      <h3>Immediate Data &amp; Account Deletion</h3>
      <p>You have full control over your data and can delete it permanently at any time:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>In-App Deletion (Settings):</strong> You can immediately and permanently delete your uploaded images, photos, documents, and associated account/app data directly from <strong>Settings</strong> inside the MedGPT App.</li>
        <li><strong>Email Deletion Request:</strong> You can also request immediate deletion at any time—even without accessing the App—by emailing <a href="mailto:purescanai@outlook.com">purescanai@outlook.com</a>. We will process and confirm your deletion request promptly.</li>
        <li><strong>Automatic 30-Day Deletion:</strong> Any uploaded images, photos, or documents that are not manually deleted earlier are automatically and permanently deleted from our servers after 30 days.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>For Users in the European Economic Area (GDPR)</h3>
      <p>Under the General Data Protection Regulation, you have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Access:</strong> Request a copy of the personal data we hold about you</li>
        <li><strong>Rectification:</strong> Request correction of inaccurate personal data</li>
        <li><strong>Erasure:</strong> Request deletion of your personal data ("Right to be Forgotten")</li>
        <li><strong>Restriction:</strong> Request restriction of processing of your personal data</li>
        <li><strong>Portability:</strong> Receive your data in a structured, machine-readable format</li>
        <li><strong>Objection:</strong> Object to the processing of your personal data</li>
        <li><strong>Withdraw Consent:</strong> Withdraw consent at any time where processing is based on consent</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>For Users in California (CCPA)</h3>
      <p>Under the California Consumer Privacy Act, California residents have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Know what personal information is being collected about them</li>
        <li>Know whether their personal information is sold or disclosed and to whom</li>
        <li>Say no to the sale of personal information</li>
        <li>Access their personal information</li>
        <li>Request deletion of their personal information</li>
        <li>Equal service and price, even if they exercise their privacy rights</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>MedGPT is not intended for use by children under the age of 13 (or 16 in the EEA). We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If we become aware that we have collected personal information from a child without parental consent, we will take steps to delete that information.</p>

      <h2>9. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>The App and Site may contain links to third-party websites or services that are not operated by us. We have no control over, and assume no responsibility for, the content, privacy policies, or practices of any third-party sites or services.</p>

      <h2>10. Cookies & Tracking</h2>
      <p>Our website may use cookies and similar tracking technologies to enhance your browsing experience. You can control cookie preferences through your browser settings. Essential cookies required for site functionality cannot be disabled.</p>

      <h2>11. International Data Transfers</h2>
      <p>Your information may be transferred to and processed in countries other than your own. We ensure that appropriate safeguards are in place to protect your data in compliance with applicable data protection laws.</p>

      <h2>12. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page and updating the "Last Updated" date. You are advised to review this Privacy Policy periodically for any changes.</p>

      <h2>13. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or wish to exercise your data rights, please contact us:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:purescanai@outlook.com">purescanai@outlook.com</a></li>
        <li><strong>Company:</strong> PureScan AI / Wellness AI (MedGPT)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
